WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.614
Before you send a private document to ChatGPT,
prepare a text copy with ShareWise.

00:00:05.614 --> 00:00:12.060
Review what is hidden on your computer, then decide
whether to share that copy with your chosen AI.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:16.000
If useful, bring the answer back and restore
matching details locally.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.569
ShareWise works offline on Windows.

00:00:18.569 --> 00:00:21.492
It never uploads your documents for processing.

00:00:21.492 --> 00:00:27.340
Open Word, PowerPoint, Excel worksheets, text PDFs,
text files or Markdown, or paste text.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.847
Detected private details become consistent
placeholders.

00:00:29.847 --> 00:00:34.859
The text detector recorded 98 percent token recall
in a synthetic benchmark.

00:00:34.859 --> 00:00:36.530
Results vary by document.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.418
Need to work from a scan?

00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:46.239
Optional Smart OCR can read printed scanned or mixed
PDFs, plus PNG, JPEG and multipage TIFF images.

00:00:46.239 --> 00:00:48.245
Recognition runs on your computer.

00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:53.060
ShareWise prepares text for review; it does not
change the source image.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:01:01.344
For each OCR page, compare the source image with the
editable recognized text and correct mistakes before
privacy analysis.

00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:04.629
This check is required even in Minimal mode.

00:01:04.629 --> 00:01:10.790
Choose automatic language selection or a subset of
English, Italian, French, German, Spanish and Dutch.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:19.220
For larger jobs, paged PDFs and images can be up to
200 pages, 512 mebibytes and two million characters.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.731
Other supported files retain smaller bounds.

00:01:21.731 --> 00:01:27.170
ShareWise reports incomplete or failed work instead
of quietly approving it for export.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.712
Minimal keeps standard inputs quick.

00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:33.425
For scanned files, it pauses for the OCR check.

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:40.025
Advanced gives you an aligned text comparison, batch
work and controls to keep or hide suggestions.

00:01:40.025 --> 00:01:42.500
Review unhighlighted text too before sharing.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.587
Add exact confidential terms you want hidden.

00:01:45.587 --> 00:01:51.917
ShareWise can also remember your deliberate keep and
hide choices locally, so repeated decisions take
less work.

00:01:51.917 --> 00:01:54.523
It does not learn from untouched suggestions.

00:01:54.523 --> 00:01:57.130
You can disable or clear this memory.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:05.554
After sharing reviewed text with an AI service of
your choice, you can optionally restore matching
placeholders with a private restoration file.

00:02:05.554 --> 00:02:07.721
Keep that file on your computer.

00:02:07.721 --> 00:02:10.610
It contains original values and is not encrypted.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:15.909
ShareWise helps you prepare, but cannot guarantee
that every sensitive detail was found.

00:02:15.909 --> 00:02:19.245
You remain responsible for deciding what can be
shared.

00:02:19.245 --> 00:02:21.840
Ask ALPINNO about current availability and
licensing.
